      "q": "How much does Scientific Research make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "Scientific Research obligated $314M from federal contracts in FY2026 to date. Scientific Research received those obligations across 91 awards, with an average award size of $3.5M, and obligations are down 36.9% year over year."
